            ],
            "attacker_controlled": false,
            "validation_layers": [
              "State transition pipeline"
            ],
            "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope",
            "notes": "Incorrect fork epoch in state would affect epoch-dependent logic."
          },
          "test_procedure": "1. Identify the upgrade_to_fulu function in the state transition code. 2. Trace how post.fork.epoch is assigned during the upgrade. 3. Verify that get_current_epoch(pre) is correctly computed and assigned to post.fork.epoch. 4. Design test cases where pre-state has edge-case epoch values (epoch 0, max epoch, boundary epochs). 5. Attempt to trigger upgrade_to_fulu at different points in the epoch lifecycle to verify consistency. 6. Check for any code paths that could set fork.epoch to a different value than the current epoch. 7. Verify that no intermediate state modifications could cause epoch drift between reading pre-state and writing post-state.",
